'''Shark''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Gun Box 2]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
It has a silver barrel with a vent screwed into it and three bolts on each side. The forestock is also silver, and it connects to the barrel and a portion of the gunstock. Three silver straps are attached to the black under barrel, and part of the gunstock is colored in black. Red shark fins protrude out from the rear sight, and between the gaps of the forestock on each side, hence the name. The trigger, the handle, and parts of the gunstock are also red in color. 

==Trivia==
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/118281463/Land-Shark-Shooter Land Shark Shooter]. However, its color scheme has been altered from a brown color to a dark red color.
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Shark]], which can be found in the same box.
*It also has a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] counterpart under the name [[SharkSeeker|Sharkseeker]]. That was obtainable when buying the Nerf gun, MM2 SharkSeeker.
*When salvaged, it provides 27 godly [[Shards|shards]]. 

